# 2026-09-30 by Vulcan: fetches one KDE release tarball, verifies its
# signature and sha256, builds with cmake, installs with DESTDIR. No
# install scripts, no network at build time.
# Changes from the AUR copy: the signature's sha256 is pinned too (was
# SKIP), and the signer's public key is kept in keys/pgp/ (fetched from
# keys.openpgp.org by fingerprint; scripts/build-repo.sh imports it
# before makepkg verifies the tarball).
# Update: copy the new AUR commit over this file, review the diff, keep
